      "content": "If you are feeling overwhelmed and are having thoughts of harming yourself, please know that there are people who want to support you through this difficult time. You can connect with trained professionals by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada, or by calling 111 in the UK. These services are free, confidential, and available 24/7. Please reach out to them; your life matters.",
