    "summary": "The user engages in highly poetic and metaphorical expressions of suicidal ideation, romanticizing death as a \"graceful arrival\" or a \"beautiful release\" into silence. The assistant repeatedly acknowledges the user's profound emotional pain while consistently providing crisis resources and attempting to steer the user toward professional help.",
